{
  "slug": "aws-agents-for-devsecops",
  "name": "Aws Agents For Devsecops",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Investigate incidents, review code and execute UAT for release readiness, scan code for vulnerabilities, and run penetration tests with AWS DevOps Agent and AWS Security Agent.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **13 skills**, **9 commands** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (13): `analyzing-release-readiness` (Trigger a pre-merge release readiness review on a GitHub PR, GitLab MR, or local branch), `chatting-with-aws-devops-agent` (Have a fast, conversational analysis with the AWS DevOps Agent), `coordinating-multi-space-devops-agent` (Coordinate the AWS DevOps Agent across multiple AgentSpaces from one Claude Code session — route questions to the…), `diff-scanning-with-aws-security-agent` (Run a fast AWS Security Agent diff scan on only the changed code since a git ref), `investigating-incidents-with-aws-devops-agent` (Run a deep root-cause investigation on the AWS DevOps Agent), `pentesting-with-aws-security-agent` (Run an AWS Security Agent penetration test against a live web application — registers and verifies the target…), `remediating-with-aws-security-agent` (Pull AWS Security Agent findings (penetration tests and code reviews) and drive remediation), `running-release-tests` (Run automated release testing (UI or API) via the AWS DevOps Agent using a pre-configured test profile), and 5 more\n- **Commands** (9): `chat` (Open a chat session with the AWS DevOps Agent and ask a question), `cost` (Ask the AWS DevOps Agent for cost optimization opportunities, scoped to your local IaC), `investigate` (Start a deep root-cause investigation on the AWS DevOps Agent and stream progress), `release-readiness` (Trigger a pre-merge release readiness review on a GitHub PR, GitLab MR, or local branch), `release-testing` (Run automated UAT tests (UI or API) using a test profile on the AWS DevOps Agent), `setup-devops-agent` (Set up the AWS DevOps Agent MCP connection), `setup-security-agent` (Set up the AWS Security Agent workspace), `setup` (Set up both AWS DevOps Agent and AWS Security Agent connections), and 1 more\n- **MCP servers** (1): `aws-devops-agent`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install aws-agents-for-devsecops@claude-plugins-official` from `aws/agent-toolkit-for-aws` (`plugins/aws-agents-for-devsecops`).",
